    cml:logicSummary "Obligation to comply with a requirement." ;
    cml:premiseText "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person is subject to a requirement under subsection 135B(2); and  (b) the person fails to comply with the requirement." ;
    cml:conclusionText "The person must comply with the requirement." ;
