    cml:logicSummary "Prohibition of non-compliance." ;
    cml:premiseText "(a) if the person is a body corporate—150 penalty units; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—30 penalty units." ;
    cml:conclusionText "Non-compliance is prohibited." ;
